A patch on upstream Mermaid at the pin, for the reference ferrigura is checked against
(docs/decisions/0014-upstream-reference-at-a-pin.md). Applied in the order of the file names by tools/reference/setup.sh.

fix(security): harden entity encoding and URL sanitization against entity-encoded schemes

Upstream encodeEntities strips color semicolons with greedy regexes across lines and
splits HTML numeric references inside URLs, while upstream formatUrl and sanitizeUrl
do not validate entity-spelled or percent-encoded URL schemes consistently. This patch
aligns the pinned reference's encodeEntities, formatUrl, and sanitizeUrl wrappers with
ferrigura's entity-aware URL sanitization and dialect-aware entity scanner. Drop or
re-check when bumping the Mermaid pin if upstream adopts equivalent URL and entity
hardening.

